  "text": "## Template 8: Complaint Resolution  \n**Subject:** Resolution to Your Complaint [EXC-XXXXX]  \n```\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nWe have completed our investigation into your complaint dated [date].\n\nComplaint Reference: [EXC-XXXXX]\n\nWhat We Found:\n[Summary of investigation findings]\n\nOur Decision:\n[Uphold / Partially uphold / Reject]\n\nResolution:\n[Action taken - refund, explanation, etc.]\n\nDetails:\n[Specific details of resolution - refund amount, dates, etc.]\n\nIf You Accept This Resolution:\nNo further action is needed. Your refund (if applicable) has been\nprocessed and will appear in your account within [timeframe].\n\nIf You Disagree With Our Decision:\nYou have the right to escalate to the Financial Ombudsman Service\n(free and independent):\n- Phone: 0800 023 4567\n- Website: www.financialombudsman.org.uk\n- You have 6 months from this letter to escalate\n\nContact Us:\nIf you have questions, reply to this email or call 0800-555-2265\nand reference your complaint ID.\n\nWe appreciate you bringing this to our attention. Your feedback helps\nus improve.\n\nBest regards,\nFirstUK Bank Complaints Resolution Team\n```  \n---",
  "name": "Chunk 10/15",
  "domain": "banking_communications",
